// Live: 3 artifacts. notes.txt (520 bytes) was never one.`,explanation:`An artifact is a file the agent saved under slash workspace slash outputs. When the turn completes, the platform copies every file there into an immutable artifact. Anything else in the sandbox, like scratch notes, is not published, and it disappears with the sandbox. So the prompt names the directory. Live, the report, the summary, and a table in a subdirectory were all published, and the notes file written in the same turn was not. The same prompt pointed at slash workspace slash reports produced correct files and no artifacts at all.`},{number:`02`,title:`List after the turn completes`,file:`server/lab29.ts`,code:`// No stream event announces an artifact. Wait for turn.completed, then list.
